WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.111
Watch and read: For your intonation practice, you ask “Where is my pen?”. What is the

00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:05.725
best answer?

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.627
The answer is: Use a questioning voice. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:13.083
helpful or correct response.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.360
Watch and read: For your intonation practice, think about this situation: You ask

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.734
“Where is my pen?”. Which choice fits?

00:00:21.617 --> 00:00:26.477
The answer is: Use a questioning voice. Use the lesson skill to make a sensible

00:00:26.477 --> 00:00:26.801
choice.
